  "title": "Days, months and telling time",
  "note": "Days and months are written in lowercase. El lunes means on Monday; los lunes means on Mondays, with no word for on. Time uses ser with la or las: Es la una (1:00), Son las tres (3:00). Add y for minutes past and menos for minutes before the hour; cuarto is a quarter and media is half.",
